        "text": "This enormous temple complex is a wonderful place to visit while in Kathmandu. It's a must-visit where you can spend a number of hours. There's a Hindu temple that's off-limits to non-Hindus, but you can see some of the temple from the outside. The cremation area is profound and very moving. An opportunity to see how another religion mourns their loved ones. The temple is very old and is full of really amazing architecture. Get ready to take a lot of photos.",
