        "title": "The ancient most temple in Nepal",
        "text": "Pashupatinath Temple, one of the most sacred places on earth for Hinduism, and one of the oldest temples of human history, and UNESCO declared World Heritage Site. The ancient temple was built around 400BC, that means a 2416 years old temple it is! There are also evidences that on that place Lord Shiva was worshiped for another 1300 years before 400BC in a shorter version without having a temple. That implies, Lord Shiva is being worshiped here since 4000 years!\n\nYou must visit the temple if you really wanted to know about the subcontinent religion and the ritual process and also their worship of Gods living in the nature.",
